            "correct_answer": "$\\frac{1}{4}y(t)$",
            "answer_explanation_blocks": [
              {
                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "By homogeneity, a scalar on the input transfers unchanged to the output. Since $T{x(t)} = y(t)$, the input $\\frac{1}{4}x(t)$ produces $T{\\frac{1}{4}x(t)} = \\frac{1}{4}T{x(t)} = \\frac{1}{4}y(t)$.",
