                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "An LTI system satisfies $T{x(t)}$ = $y(t)$. Which statement best explains why the outputs for $5x(t)$, $x(t - 6)$, and $5x(t - 6)$ can all be predicted from $y(t)$?",
